scenario: start zoomcar booking
  Click the Start your wonderful journey

scenario: perform search
  Click the search bar
  Clear the search bar
  Type "indra" into the search bar
  Click the suggested location as Indranagar
  Click the next button

scenario: select date and time
  Click the div 3 div 2 div 3
  Click the slider time
  Click the next button
  Click the div 3 div 2 div 3
  Click the slider time
  Click the next button
  Wait 8 seconds

scenario: select car and login
  Click the book now
  // it will open login modal where you need to pass login details
  Click the user email field
  Type "atul.sharma@zoomcar.com" into the user email
  Click the next button
  Type "aabc581321" into the password

scenario: checkout the selected car
  Click the form div 3 img
  Click the checkoutButton

scenario: initiate payment
  Click the card
  Click the expiry month
  Type "08" into the expiry month
  Click the expiry year
  Type "2019" into the expiry year
  Click the cvv
  Type "123" into the text box
  Click the input type text
  Type "5123  4567  8901  2346" into the text box identifier and enter card number

scenario: logout
  Click the menu icon
  Click the logout button
